    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0168",
      "reading_order": 222,
      "section": "Loading",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 91.11,
        "t": 415.801,
        "r": 509.6071999999996,
        "b": 403.624
      },
      "content": "When the net pressure is below the loading pressure, solenoid valve (Y1) is energised. Results:",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_221",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2       General description"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_221",
          "title": "Loading"
        }
      ],
      "page": 23,
      "chunk_hint": "section_start",
      "semantic_role": "overview",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0169",
      "reading_order": 223,
      "section": "Loading",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 91.11,
        "t": 396.661,
        "r": 527.9947999999993,
        "b": 371.28400000000005
      },
      "content": "The space above unloading valve/blow-off valve (UV) is connected with the oil separator tank pressure (1) via the solenoid valve.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_221",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2       General description"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_221",
          "title": "Loading"
        }
      ],
      "page": 23,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0170",
      "reading_order": 224,
      "section": "Loading",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 91.11,
        "t": 364.321,
        "r": 549.8000999999991,
        "b": 338.9440000000001
      },
      "content": "Unloading valve/blow-off valve (UV) moves downwards, closing off the connection to channels (2) and (3).",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_221",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2       General description"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_221",
          "title": "Loading"
        }
      ],
      "page": 23,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0171",
      "reading_order": 225,
      "section": "Loading",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 91.11,
        "t": 331.98100000000005,
        "r": 548.2567999999994,
        "b": 306.60400000000004
      },
      "content": "Underpressure from the compressor element causes loading plunger (LP) to move downwards and inlet valve (IV) to open fully.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_221",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2       General description"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_221",
          "title": "Loading"
        }
      ],
      "page": 23,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0172",
      "reading_order": 226,
      "section": "Loading",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 91.11,
        "t": 299.58050000000003,
        "r": 311.63139999999987,
        "b": 287.4035000000001
      },
      "content": "Air delivery is 100%, the compressor runs loaded.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_221",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2       General description"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_221",
          "title": "Loading"
        }
      ],
      "page": 23,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0173",
      "reading_order": 227,
      "section": "Unloading",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 57.0903,
        "t": 280.59450000000015,
        "r": 111.0981,
        "b": 268.3185000000001
      },
      "content": "Unloading",
      "level": 2,
      "section_id": "sec_auto_227",
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2       General description"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_227",
          "title": "Unloading"
        }
      ],
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "page": 23,
      "chunk_hint": "section_heading",
      "semantic_role": "section_heading",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0174",
      "reading_order": 228,
      "section": "Unloading",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 91.11,
        "t": 261.30050000000006,
        "r": 553.1055999999992,
        "b": 235.9235000000001
      },
      "content": "If the air consumption is less than the air output of the compressor, the net pressure increases. When the net pressure reaches the unloading pressure, solenoid valve (Y1) is de-energised. Results:",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_227",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2       General description"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_227",
          "title": "Unloading"
        }
      ],
      "page": 23,
      "chunk_hint": "section_start",
      "semantic_role": "overview",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0175",
      "reading_order": 229,
      "section": "Unloading",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 91.11,
        "t": 228.96050000000014,
        "r": 543.7709999999995,
        "b": 203.58350000000019
      },
      "content": "The pressure above unloading valve/blow-off valve (UV) is released to atmosphere and the space above valve (UV) is no longer in connection with the oil separator tank pressure (1).",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_227",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2       General description"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_227",
          "title": "Unloading"
        }
      ],
      "page": 23,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0176",
      "reading_order": 230,
      "section": "Unloading",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 91.11,
        "t": 196.62050000000022,
        "r": 554.201200000001,
        "b": 171.24350000000015
      },
      "content": "Unloading valve/blow-off valve (UV) moves upwards, connecting the oil separator tank pressure (1) with channels (2) and (3).",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_227",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2       General description"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_227",
          "title": "Unloading"
        }
      ],
      "page": 23,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0177",
      "reading_order": 231,
      "section": "Unloading",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 91.11,
        "t": 164.2805000000002,
        "r": 564.6908000000008,
        "b": 138.90350000000024
      },
      "content": "The pressure in channel (2) causes the loading plunger (LP) to move upwards, causing inlet valve (IV) to close, while the pressure is gradually released to atmosphere.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_227",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2       General description"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_227",
          "title": "Unloading"
        }
      ],
      "page": 23,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0178",
      "reading_order": 232,
      "section": "Unloading",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 91.11,
        "t": 131.88000000000022,
        "r": 535.4461999999991,
        "b": 106.50300000000016
      },
      "content": "The pressure in the separator tank stabilises at low value. A small amount of air is kept drawn in to guarantee a minimal pressure, required for lubrication during unloaded operation.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_227",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2       General description"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_227",
          "title": "Unloading"
        }
      ],
      "page": 23,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0179",
      "reading_order": 233,
      "section": "Unloading",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 91.11,
        "t": 99.54000000000019,
        "r": 322.8634999999998,
        "b": 87.36300000000017
      },
      "content": "Air output is stopped, the compressor runs unloaded.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_227",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2       General description"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_227",
          "title": "Unloading"
        }
      ],
      "page": 23,
